      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I find your words cut deep, Kaelen, and I am so sorry to hear you feel this alone.\n\nPlease know that your sacrifice has not gone unnoticed by anyone who still breathes, and you are alive right now, that count for more than any future I can never promise.\n\nYou need to take a deep breath and let me help you find a quiet place to rest while we figure out how to move forward, even a small step at a time.",
